  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Probability (exactly one of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;occurs)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are independent events.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
